<div id="pf16" class="pf w0 h0" data-page-no="16"><div class="pc pc16 w0 h0"><img class="bi x3 y24c w2 h2e" alt="" src="bg16.png"/><div class="t m0 x3 he y30 ff9 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff2">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">5<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>章<span class="_ _12"> </span>网络层<span class="_ _62"> </span><span class="ff3">5.6<span class="_ _12"> </span>OSPF (</span>开放最短路径优先<span class="ff3">)</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x6 h7 y24d ff4 fs1 fc2 sc0 ls0 ws0">算法核心逻辑</div><div class="t m0 x6 h6 y24e ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">第一步：修改报文</div><div class="t m0 x6 h6 y24f ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">将收到的报文中所有项目的<span class="ff1">下一跳改为<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑋<span class="_ _11"></span></span></span>，所有<span class="ff1">距离加<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">1</span></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x6 h6 y250 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">第二步：与原表对比更新</div><div class="t m0 x85 h6 y251 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">1.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">无路则加<span class="ff4">：原表中没有该目的网络<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">→<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>直接添加<span class="ff4">。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x85 h6 y252 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">2.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">同路必换<span class="ff4">：<span class="_ _27"></span>原表中已有该网络，<span class="_ _27"></span>且下一跳也是<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑋<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ffa">→<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff1">无条件更新<span class="_ _2c"></span><span class="ff4">（以最新消息为准，<span class="_ _27"></span>哪怕距离变大）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><div class="t m0 x85 h6 y253 ff3 fs1 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">3.<span class="_ _b"> </span><span class="ff1 fc0">异路更优<span class="ff4">：原表中有该网络，但下一跳不是<span class="_ _28"> </span><span class="ff8">𝑋<span class="_ _11"></span></span>：</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x86 h6 y254 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">若新距离<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">&lt;<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>原距离<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">→<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff1">更新</span></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x86 h6 y255 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">若新距离<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">≥<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>原距离<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ffa">→<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff1">不更新</span></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x6 h6 y256 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">第三步：超时处理</div><div class="t m0 x6 h7 y257 ff4 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">若<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">3<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>分钟未收到邻居更新，判定邻居不可达（距离置<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">16</span>）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y258 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.5.4<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">计算实例</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h6 y259 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">题目<span class="ff4">：路由器<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">C<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>收到邻居<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">B<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>发来的路由信息。请写出<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">C<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>更新后的路由表。</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h6 y25a ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">目的<span class="_ _63"> </span><span class="ff6">C<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>的原表<span class="_ _63"> </span><span class="ff6">B<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>发来的<span class="_ _64"> </span><span class="ff6">C<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>更新后的表</div><div class="t m0 xe h6 y25b ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">网络<span class="_ _65"> </span>距离<span class="_ _3a"> </span>下一跳<span class="_ _39"> </span>距离<span class="_ _66"> </span>新距离<span class="_ _3a"> </span>新下一跳<span class="_ _65"> </span>更新原因</div><div class="t m0 xe h7 y25c ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Net1<span class="_ _67"> </span>7<span class="_ _68"> </span>A<span class="_ _69"> </span>5<span class="_ _5d"> </span><span class="ff6">6<span class="_ _6a"> </span>B<span class="_ _6b"> </span><span class="ff4">异路更优<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>(<span class="ffb">5<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>1<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">&lt;<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>7</span>)</div><div class="t m0 xe h7 y25d ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Net2<span class="_ _67"> </span>3<span class="_ _6c"> </span>E<span class="_ _6a"> </span>4<span class="_ _6d"> </span>3<span class="_ _6a"> </span>E<span class="_ _6e"> </span><span class="ff4">异路不优<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>(<span class="ffb">4<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>1<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">&gt;<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>3</span>)</div><div class="t m0 xe h7 y25e ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Net6<span class="_ _67"> </span>5<span class="_ _6f"> </span>F<span class="_ _70"> </span>4<span class="_ _5d"> </span>5<span class="_ _70"> </span>F<span class="_ _71"> </span><span class="ff4">距离相等，保持原样</span></div><div class="t m0 xe h7 y25f ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Net8<span class="_ _67"> </span>4<span class="_ _6c"> </span>E<span class="_ _6a"> </span>2<span class="_ _6d"> </span><span class="ff6">3<span class="_ _6a"> </span>B<span class="_ _6b"> </span><span class="ff4">异路更优<span class="_ _0"> </span></span></span>(<span class="ffb">2<span class="_ _8"> </span><span class="ffa">+<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>1<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff8">&lt;<span class="_ _28"> </span></span>4</span>)</div><div class="t m0 xe h7 y260 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Net9<span class="_ _72"> </span>(<span class="ff4">无此项</span>)<span class="_ _3f"> </span>5<span class="_ _6d"> </span><span class="ff6">6<span class="_ _6a"> </span>B<span class="_ _6b"> </span><span class="ff4">无路则加</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h13 y261 ff9 fs4 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _5"> </span><span class="ff6">5.6<span class="_ _24"> </span>OSPF<span class="_ _5"> </span>(<span class="ff1">开放最短路径优先</span>)</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y262 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.6.1<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">基本概念</span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y263 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">定义<span class="ff4">：<span class="ff3">OSPF<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>是基于</span>链路状态<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(Link<span class="_ _29"></span>-St<span class="_ _f"></span>ate)<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">的内部网关协议<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3">(IGP)</span>。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y264 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">适用范围<span class="ff4">：设计用于在一个</span>自治系统<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff6">(AS)<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">内部运行。</span></span></div><div class="t m0 x1e h6 y265 ff1 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">名称含义<span class="ff4">：</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y266 ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">Open<span class="_ _0"> </span>(<span class="ff1">开放</span>)<span class="ff4">：表示该协议规范是公开发表的（非厂商私有）<span class="_ _2"></span>。</span></div><div class="t m0 x25 h6 y267 ff6 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">SPF<span class="_ _0"> </span>(<span class="ff1">最短路径优先</span>)<span class="ff4">：表示使用<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>Di<span class="_ _3"></span>jkstra<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">提出的最短路径算法。</span></div><div class="t m0 x11 h20 y268 ff6 fs5 fc7 sc0 ls0 ws0">5.6.2<span class="_ _32"> </span><span class="ff1">核心机制：三步走</span></div><div class="t m0 x26 h7 y269 ff3 fs1 fc0 sc0 ls0 ws0">OSPF<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">的核心在于构建和维护全网一致的链路状态数据库，并据此计算路由。</span></div><div class="t m0 x3 he y5f ff9 fs1 fc8 sc0 ls0 ws0"><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc7"><span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff4">第<span class="_ _0"> </span><span class="ff3 fc0">17<span class="_ _0"> </span></span>页<span class="_ _0"> </span></span><span class="_ _44"> </span><span class="fc9"></span></span></div></div